{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1357073-the-final-monthly-exalted","id":1357073,"title":"THE FINAL MONTHLY EXALTED","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-12-26T11:23:55-08:00","id":1357073,"title":"THE FINAL MONTHLY EXALTED","content":"So the that is done. Is there an ETA for the compilation book being available?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10745-nosleeves","name":"nosleeves","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"73"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-26T12:19:01-08:00","id":1357083,"title":"","content":"I wondered if it actually is the final one, or if the Monday Meeting notes just meant the final ones of this year. HDNP is definitely long enough, but Adversaries is pretty short, and Minton said he'd written a third-circle demon for it, which is yet to be released.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-26T12:29:14-08:00","id":1357085,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1357073-the-final-monthly-exalted?p=1357083#post1357083\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I wondered if it actually is the final one, or if the Monday Meeting notes just meant the final ones of this year. HDNP is definitely long enough, but Adversaries is pretty short, and Minton said he'd written a third-circle demon for it, which is yet to be released.</div> </div> </div> </div>Maybe the third circle demon is going to be in the compilation book only? I'd really hate to have to buy a compiled book when I have so many of the entries already, but it's not the worst thing in the world.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-26T13:47:06-08:00","id":1357099,"title":"","content":"Per Rich in the Monday Meeting comments it's indeed the final one period, and there'll be additional entries for both Adversaries and Hundred Devils in the compiled books.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-27T02:00:28-08:00","id":1357175,"title":"","content":"Ah, okay, that makes sense. It's a way to make sure people who have a bunch of pdfs still get the pdf.<br /> <br /> I hope they still have that idea to give a discount to people who have bought the pdfs, though I don't know if Drivethrurpg allows that. I think I've already spent something like \u00a340 on it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-27T03:32:38-08:00","id":1357178,"title":"","content":"DTRPG can definitely handle a discount for people that bought a PDF already; though I can imagine making it proportional to how many of the individual PDFs you bought might be hard.<br /> <br /> If that's the case, I say give out a flat decent discount. Just like crowdfunding, some people put up more, even though everyone benefits from some stretch goals.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-27T03:47:06-08:00","id":1357179,"title":"","content":"I'm going to respond appropriately to the thread title.<br /> <br /> IT'S THE FINAL COUNTDOWN!<br /> DO DA DO DO, DO DO DO DA DO, DO DA DO DO\u2026","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-29T06:44:49-08:00","id":1357527,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1357073-the-final-monthly-exalted?p=1357178#post1357178\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">DTRPG can definitely handle a discount for people that bought a PDF already; though I can imagine making it proportional to how many of the individual PDFs you bought might be hard.<br /> <br /> If that's the case, I say give out a flat decent discount. Just like crowdfunding, some people put up more, even though everyone benefits from some stretch goals.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd rather have a proportional discount... But I'd rather have a flat discount than no discount.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-29T06:53:50-08:00","id":1357530,"title":"","content":"Presumably, if they've decided to stop releasing monthly pdfs, they're going to release the two books properly next year. And my impression is, certainly with HDNP, that more stuff is actually written. It may be that this is why they're stopping the pdf releases, maybe they've finished writing it. So perhaps it's just a matter of formatting and art; although of course, they have art for all the stuff released so far.<br /> <br /> I wonder then if HDNP will be released in the first half of 2020, but perhaps Adversaries much later as there's still a lot more art to do (and maybe writing; it's far, far shorter so far than HDNP).<br /> <br /> I guess we should watch for next time they release the current status of projects and see where HDNP and Adversaries are (first draft, Art Notes, etc).<br /> <br /> I hope though that they give HDNP's rules an edit thiugh. There's a lot of entries with cool art, a cool idea, some interesting charms, and one poorly-written power that's OP (or occasionally, rubbish). In a way I didn't find with Lunars: Fangs at the Gate or Dragonblood: What Fire has Wrought.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-29T10:46:58-08:00","id":1357565,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1357073-the-final-monthly-exalted?p=1357530#post1357530\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I hope though that they give HDNP's rules an edit thiugh. There's a lot of entries with cool art, a cool idea, some interesting charms, and one poorly-written power that's OP (or occasionally, rubbish). In a way I didn't find with Lunars: Fangs at the Gate or Dragonblood: What Fire has Wrought.</div> </div> </div> </div>Which entries are those?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-30T01:13:06-08:00","id":1357720,"title":"","content":"I am on holiday so I can't really go through examples clearly. Also my computer with all my pdfs on is broken. So I can maybe show you examples in, like, a week? Sorry.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-30T03:24:49-08:00","id":1357733,"title":"","content":"Pretty sure after the books are compiled there'll be a couple of sticky threads for errors people have spotted.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-30T04:29:11-08:00","id":1357738,"title":"","content":"I haven't really seen any errors, it's more like there's a charm that gives people defining intimacies in one roll, or ice-horses that if you punch them your hand is stuck until you succeed on a gambit (which may mean you're stuck forever if you don't have enough initiative), or an enemy that's literally unkillable by a swordsman. Or to take a different kind of example, a charm that lets you instill a minor intimacy. A lot of these might be fine with some editing for clarifying text or something, but they're not really the kind of errors those threads are for.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-30T04:33:49-08:00","id":1357739,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1357073-the-final-monthly-exalted?p=1357738#post1357738\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">ice-horses that if you punch them your hand is stuck until you succeed on a gambit (which may mean you're stuck forever if you don't have enough initiative)</div> </div> </div> </div>Or, y'know, you lose the fingers to frostbite.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-30T05:12:27-08:00","id":1357746,"title":"","content":"That too. <br /> <br /> You've reminded me, I need to make my players in the northern bordermarches roll for frostbite, thanks.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-30T09:22:41-08:00","id":1357797,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1357073-the-final-monthly-exalted?p=1357738#post1357738\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">ice-horses that if you punch them your hand is stuck until you succeed on a gambit (which may mean you're stuck forever if you don't have enough initiative)</div> </div> </div> </div>Have you seen the write up for the Greenmaw in the Corebook?<br /> <br /> If they connect a grapple whilst you have 4 or fewer Initative it's an Instant Kill as you get eaten alive.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-30T09:45:05-08:00","id":1357804,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JohnDoe244</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1357073-the-final-monthly-exalted?p=1357797#post1357797\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Have you seen the write up for the Greenmaw in the Corebook?<br /> <br /> If they connect a grapple whilst you have 4 or fewer Initative it's an Instant Kill as you get eaten alive.</div> </div> </div> </div>Its digestive tract is a Difficulty 5 environmental hazard, with a Difficulty of 3L/round. What writeup are you reading where it's an Instant Kill?<br /> <br /> \u200bEDIT: Shit, it even <i>specifies</i> that you can further damage it from inside it with an appropriate stunt, so <i>even if</i> you don't have a buddy to cut you out as its acids chew through your Ox-Bodies, <i>you can still wither it from the inside to get the Initiative to attempt to cut your way out</i>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":177,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","user":"TheCountAlucard","date":". 12-30-2019, 12:49 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-30T23:10:30-08:00","id":1357959,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1357073-the-final-monthly-exalted?p=1357804#post1357804\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What writeup are you reading where it's an Instant Kill?</div> </div> </div> </div> I suspect he's partially remembering Devouring Leviathan Maw, a Magical Ability for familiars which can automatically kill someone by swallowing them whole if the raw damage from a decisive bite exceeds their (Stamina + Resistance + Health Levels).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-30T23:17:49-08:00","id":1357961,"title":"","content":"That's still a much higher threshold than &quot;connect a grapple whilst you have 4 or fewer Initiative.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-31T01:14:13-08:00","id":1357973,"title":"","content":"Yeah my bad. I'm thinking of Thorn Toothed Maw's land a Decisive Bite which deals 3+ levels of damage.<br /> <br /> &quot;A swallowed enemy may attempt to cut his way free with a <b>difficulty 5 gambit</b> rolled against the greenmaw\u2019s Defense, but <b>cannot otherwise damage the elemental while inside it, as the digestive tract is completely dissociated from its vitals.</b>&quot;<br /> <br /> What is, in your mind, an appropriate Stunt to bypass that?<br /> <br /> Yes. You can absolutely bypass it with a Stunt. No contest Your Honor. I'd love to read the Stunt.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":531,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","user":"JohnDoe244","date":". 12-31-2019, 04:20 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-31T01:48:35-08:00","id":1357977,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JohnDoe244</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1357073-the-final-monthly-exalted?p=1357973#post1357973\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yeah my bad. I'm thinking of Thorn Toothed Maw's land a Decisive Bite which deals 3+ levels of damage.<br /> <br /> &amp;quot;A swallowed enemy may attempt to cut his way free with a <b>difficulty 5 gambit</b> rolled against the greenmaw\u2019s Defense, but <b>cannot otherwise damage the elemental while inside it, as the digestive tract is completely dissociated from its vitals.</b>&amp;quot;<br /> <br /> What is, in your mind, an appropriate Stunt to bypass that?<br /> <br /> Yes. You can absolutely bypass it with a Stunt. No contest Your Honor. I'd love to read the Stunt.</div> </div> </div> </div>Withering attacks based and throwing your considerable weight around inside it or pulling yourself out to push at its mouth or twisting to wrap the track around itself.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The Book of Laughing Serpents Series(Latest <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/293793/Book-of-Laughing-Serpents-Volume-7\" target=\"_blank\">Here</a>)<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/287741/Many-Limbed-Manual?src=hottest_filtered&amp;filters=45622\" target=\"_blank\">Many Limbed Manual</a><br /> Patreon here: <a href=\"https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety\" target=\"_blank\">https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety</a><br /> San Jeanro Co-Op writer. Volume 1 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/278871/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 2 <a href=\"https://t.co/SXRLElZlw4?amp=1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 3 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/297692/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-3?affiliate_id=389642\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> My folklore and horror blog, here:<a href=\"http://undeadauthorsociety.wordpres.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://undeadauthorsociety.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11835-epee102","name":"Epee102","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11835_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-31T02:07:37-08:00","id":1357978,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JohnDoe244</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1357073-the-final-monthly-exalted?p=1357973#post1357973\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What is, in your mind, an appropriate Stunt to bypass that?</div> </div> </div> </div>That's up to the ST and players to decide.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JohnDoe244</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1357073-the-final-monthly-exalted?p=1357973#post1357973\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yes. You can absolutely bypass it with a Stunt. No contest Your Honor. I'd love to read the Stunt.</div> </div> </div> </div>Please don't be That Guy.<br /> <br /> But, <b>since you asked</b>...<br /> <br /> Keiko grits her teeth and tries to calm herself as the acids sizzle against her armor; it would not do to panic now. Extending her senses as far as her Essence would allow, she realizes that the elemental predator that has consumed her is slinking back to its lair to digest its meal. She grips Earth-Dragon's Tooth, her white jade short daiklave, and times her strike precisely, piercing the blade down through the sac in which her body is held. The jadesteel bites into the rock, causing the elemental to strain against the sudden snag; just as suddenly, Keiko withdraws the daiklave and shifts her weight, and the elemental falls down the tunnel.<br /> <br /> Keiko, padded from the fall by the beast's digestive tract, recovers quickly, and plunges her blade again and again into the elemental's fibrous flesh, and then tears her way free from it, triumphant and blazing with Earth-Essence. The greenmaw roars at her, but it seems less sure of itself now, now that it knows it faces a Prince of the Earth.<br /> <br /> \u200b----------------------------<br /> <br /> Mechanically, she did a withering attack that crashed the elemental, and on the next turn, succeeded at the gambit to escape.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":177,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","user":"TheCountAlucard","date":". 12-31-2019, 05:11 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-31T02:41:30-08:00","id":1357980,"title":"","content":"Bigger issues might be little things--the frog elemental we just got can't regain iniative as written (or is extremely hard, with 0 basic damage). The earth elemental doomsday prepper is cool, but that Eclipse charm can give a Dragonblooded a free excellency indefinetly so might be worth revisiting. I expect maybe a spell to actually bind or command these stronger elementals etc.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The Book of Laughing Serpents Series(Latest <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/293793/Book-of-Laughing-Serpents-Volume-7\" target=\"_blank\">Here</a>)<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/287741/Many-Limbed-Manual?src=hottest_filtered&amp;filters=45622\" target=\"_blank\">Many Limbed Manual</a><br /> Patreon here: <a href=\"https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety\" target=\"_blank\">https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety</a><br /> San Jeanro Co-Op writer. Volume 1 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/278871/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 2 <a href=\"https://t.co/SXRLElZlw4?amp=1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 3 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/297692/The-Short-Games-Diges